# Aspen: a tall, very straight pale trunk (grey-green, Bark Scars: dark diamonds, few large Lenticels) bare for half its height, a NARROW
# rounded crown of short ascending limbs whose twigs do not hang (low Droop), ROUND leaves (ClusterLeafWidth ~ the
# length) on long stalks that tremble (Wind Branch > 1). Shares the birches' climate: Forest types make aspen stands.
